I wanted the final output to look visually appealing while still making the information clear and understandable.

🎀 Design Choices

I carried over elements from my previous activities, especially:

🩷 My chosen color palette
✍🏻 My selected typography
🎨 Design principles
📐 Organized layouts
✨ Visual hierarchy
💗 Consistent design elements

